# The repo lives on an NTFS mount (/mnt/d) reached from both Windows and WSL.
# Without this, a Windows-side write flips a file to CRLF and git reports the
# whole file as rewritten — one such episode showed 137 files / 35k lines of
# churn with zero content change.  Normalise to LF in the index and on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary deliverables and data: never touch, never diff as text.
*.parquet binary
*.joblib  binary
*.docx    binary
*.pptx    binary
*.pdf     binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.ipynb   -text
